div(class="min-h-full bg-[#F3F6F1] text-[#273726]")
    section(class="merchant-hero relative overflow-hidden px-4 pb-6 pt-5 text-white")
        div(class="merchant-hero-glow", aria-hidden="true")
        div(class="relative z-10")
            div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3")
                div(class="min-w-0")
                    div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                        span(class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/12 px-2.5 py-1 text-[9px] font-extrabold ring-1 ring-white/15")
                            span(class="size-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-[#F4C15D]")
                            | 마켓버틀러 운영 중
                        span(class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/60") {{todayLabel}}
                    p(class="mt-4 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#BDD8BF]") Merchant store report
                    h1(class="mt-1 truncate text-2xl font-black tracking-[-0.045em]") 김명자 홍총떡
                    p(class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-white/65") 홍천중앙시장 나동 04호 · 대표 김명자
                span(class="flex size-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[20px] bg-[#FFF0DD] text-3xl shadow-lg shadow-black/10") 🥞

            div(class="mt-5 rounded-[20px] bg-white/10 p-4 ring-1 ring-white/15 backdrop-blur")
                p(class="text-base font-black tracking-[-0.025em]") 장사에 필요한 내용만 한눈에
                p(class="mt-1 text-[10px] leading-5 text-white/70") 판매 상품과 매출은 확인만 하세요. 등록·촬영·재고 입력과 주문 처리는 마켓버틀러가 맡습니다.

    main(class="space-y-5 px-4 pb-32 pt-5")
        section(class="rounded-[22px] border border-[#C7E7CC] bg-[#EDF6EB] p-4")
            div(class="flex items-start gap-3")
                span(class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white text-xl shadow-sm") 🤝
                div(class="min-w-0")
                    p(class="text-sm font-black text-[#315A32]") 앱을 계속 확인하지 않아도 됩니다
                    p(class="mt-1 text-[10px] leading-5 text-[#647861]") 꼭 필요한 준비 내용은 마켓버틀러가 방문하거나 전화로 다시 알려드립니다.
            div(class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2")
                div(class="rounded-xl bg-white/75 px-2 py-2.5 text-center")
                    span(class="block text-base") 📷
                    span(class="mt-1 block text-[9px] font-black text-[#526A52]") 촬영 없음
                div(class="rounded-xl bg-white/75 px-2 py-2.5 text-center")
                    span(class="block text-base") 🧺
                    span(class="mt-1 block text-[9px] font-black text-[#526A52]") 등록 없음
                div(class="rounded-xl bg-white/75 px-2 py-2.5 text-center")
                    span(class="block text-base") ✍️
                    span(class="mt-1 block text-[9px] font-black text-[#526A52]") 입력 없음

        section
            div(class="flex items-end justify-between gap-3")
                div
                    p(class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#2E7D32]") Today notice
                    h2(class="mt-1 text-lg font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#273726]") 오늘 준비할 내용
                span(class="rounded-full bg-[#FFF3BF] px-2.5 py-1 text-[9px] font-black text-[#8A651A]") 1건

            article(class="mt-3 rounded-[22px] border border-[#F0D5A7] bg-[#FFF8E9] p-4 shadow-sm")
                div(class="flex items-start gap-3")
                    span(class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white text-xl shadow-sm") 🔔
                    div(class="min-w-0 flex-1")
                        div(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2")
                            p(class="text-sm font-black text-[#6E4F20]") 홍총떡 5장 · 2팩 준비
                            span(class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white px-2 py-1 text-[8px] font-black text-[#97631F]") 14:00 수거
                        p(class="mt-1 text-[10px] leading-5 text-[#8E7042]") 버틀러가 방문해 수거합니다. 앱에서 접수하거나 상태를 바꿀 필요는 없습니다.
                div(class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white/70 px-3 py-2.5")
                    span(class="text-sm") 📞
                    p(class="text-[9px] font-bold leading-4 text-[#7C6848]") 수량 변경은 버틀러가 방문하거나 전화할 때 말씀해 주세요.

        section
            div(class="flex items-end justify-between gap-3")
                div
                    p(class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#2E7D32]") Today sales
                    h2(class="mt-1 text-lg font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#273726]") 오늘 매출 상세
                span(class="text-[9px] font-semibold text-[#7B8879]") 자동 집계 · 시연

            article(class="mt-3 rounded-[24px] bg-[#2F241D] p-5 text-white shadow-[0_14px_35px_rgba(47,36,29,0.16)]")
                div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3")
                    div
                        p(class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50") 오늘 온라인 판매 금액
                        p(class="mt-1 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.04em]") 36,000
                            span(class="ml-1 text-xs font-bold text-white/70") 원
                        p(class="mt-1 text-[9px] font-bold text-[#FFD39F]") 어제 같은 시간보다 12% ↑
                    span(class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 text-xl") 💰

                div(class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2")
                    div(class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-2 py-3 text-center")
                        p(class="text-[8px] font-bold text-white/45") 주문
                        p(class="mt-1 text-sm font-black") 2건
                    div(class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-2 py-3 text-center")
                        p(class="text-[8px] font-bold text-white/45") 판매 수량
                        p(class="mt-1 text-sm font-black") 3팩
                    div(class="rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-2 py-3 text-center")
                        p(class="text-[8px] font-bold text-white/45") 평균 주문
                        p(class="mt-1 text-sm font-black") 18,000원

                div(class="mt-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-4")
                    div(class="flex items-center justify-between")
                        p(class="text-[10px] font-black text-white/75") 상품별 매출
                        span(class="text-[8px] text-white/40") 버틀러 정리
                    div(*ngFor="let item of salesBreakdown", class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-3 py-2.5")
                        span(class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-base", [ngClass]="item.bg") {{item.emoji}}
                        div(class="min-w-0 flex-1")
                            p(class="truncate text-[10px] font-extrabold") {{item.name}}
                            p(class="mt-0.5 text-[8px] text-white/45") {{item.quantity}}{{item.unit}} 판매
                        p(class="shrink-0 text-[10px] font-black") {{item.amount | number}}원

                div(class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2")
                    div(*ngFor="let payment of paymentBreakdown", class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 px-3 py-2.5")
                        p(class="text-[8px] text-white/45") {{payment.label}}
                        p(class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-black") {{payment.amount | number}}원

        section
            div(class="flex items-end justify-between gap-3")
                div
                    p(class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#2E7D32]") My products
                    h2(class="mt-1 text-lg font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#273726]") 내가 판매 중인 상품
                span(class="rounded-full bg-[#EDF6EB] px-2.5 py-1 text-[9px] font-black text-[#2E7D32]") 공개 1개

            div(class="mt-3 space-y-3")
                article(*ngFor="let product of merchantProducts", class="rounded-[22px] border border-[#DCE5D9] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm")
                    div(class="flex items-center gap-3")
                        span(class="flex size-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[18px] text-3xl", [ngClass]="product.bg") {{product.emoji}}
                        div(class="min-w-0 flex-1")
                            div(class="flex items-center gap-1.5")
                                p(class="truncate text-xs font-black text-[#344333]") {{product.name}}
                                span(class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#EDF6EB] px-2 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-extrabold text-[#2E7D32]") {{product.status}}
                            p(class="mt-1 text-[9px] text-[#7B8879]") {{product.category}} · {{product.unit}}
                            p(class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-black text-[#273726]") {{product.price | number}}원
                    div(class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 border-t border-[#E8EEE6] pt-3")
                        div(class="rounded-xl bg-[#F7FAF6] px-2 py-2.5 text-center")
                            p(class="text-[8px] font-bold text-[#8A9688]") 버틀러 확인
                            p(class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-black text-[#40503F]") {{product.stock}}팩
                        div(class="rounded-xl bg-[#F7FAF6] px-2 py-2.5 text-center")
                            p(class="text-[8px] font-bold text-[#8A9688]") 오늘 판매
                            p(class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-black text-[#40503F]") {{product.sold}}팩
                        div(class="rounded-xl bg-[#F7FAF6] px-2 py-2.5 text-center")
                            p(class="text-[8px] font-bold text-[#8A9688]") 주문 마감
                            p(class="mt-1 text-[10px] font-black text-[#40503F]") {{product.cutoff}}
                    p(class="mt-3 text-[9px] leading-4 text-[#859182]") 버틀러가 {{product.confirmedAt}} 확인 · 상품 수정과 품절 반영도 대신 처리합니다.

        section
            div
                p(class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#2E7D32]") Store schedule
                h2(class="mt-1 text-lg font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#273726]") 가게 운영 일정
            article(class="mt-3 divide-y divide-[#E8EEE6] overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] border border-[#DCE5D9] bg-white")
                div(*ngFor="let schedule of storeSchedule", class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3.5")
                    span(class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-lg", [ngClass]="schedule.bg") {{schedule.icon}}
                    div(class="min-w-0 flex-1")
                        p(class="text-[9px] font-bold text-[#7B8879]") {{schedule.label}}
                        p(class="mt-0.5 text-[11px] font-black text-[#40503F]") {{schedule.note}}
                    p(class="shrink-0 text-[10px] font-black text-[#2E7D32]") {{schedule.value}}
            p(class="mt-2 text-[9px] leading-4 text-[#859182]") 일정이나 수량이 달라지면 버틀러 방문 시 말씀해 주세요.

        section(class="rounded-[20px] border border-[#C7E7CC] bg-[#EDF6EB] p-4")
            div(class="flex items-start gap-3")
                span(class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white text-xl shadow-sm") 🧑‍🌾
                div(class="min-w-0")
                    p(class="text-xs font-black text-[#315A32]") 촬영·등록·재고·주문은 버틀러 처리 중
                    p(class="mt-1 text-[9px] leading-4 text-[#647861]") 상인은 판매 상품과 매출, 방문·정산 일정만 확인하면 됩니다.
